{"id":"n1-108","title":"Noun を経て","romaji":"〜wo hete","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses the idea of 'through' or 'via'; going through some process or phase.","longExplanation":"The を経て grammar point is used to express the concept of going through some process, phase, place, or period of time as a means of achieving something or reaching some end point. It can be literally translated as 'through' or 'via' in English, and can be used both literally and metaphorically.","formation":"Noun + を経て","examples":[{"jp":"彼は苦労を経て成功を手に入れた。","romaji":"Kare wa kurō o hete seikō o te ni ireta.","en":"He achieved success through hardships.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"苦労","vocabId":"1244680","reading":"くろう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"経","vocabId":"1956170","reading":"きょう","baseForm":"経る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"成功","vocabId":"1375690","reading":"せいこう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"手","vocabId":"1327190","reading":"て"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"入れ","vocabId":"1465600","reading":"いれ","baseForm":"入れる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"彼女はニューヨークを経て日本に帰国した。","romaji":"Kanojo wa Nyūyōku o hete Nihon ni kikoku shita.","en":"She returned to Japan via New York.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ニューヨーク","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"経","vocabId":"1956170","reading":"きょう","baseForm":"経る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"日本","vocabId":"1582710","reading":"にほん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"帰国","vocabId":"1221330","reading":"きこく"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"私達は長い議論を経て決定を下した。","romaji":"Watashitachi wa nagai giron o hete kettei o kudashita.","en":"We made a decision through a long discussion.","words":[{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"達","vocabId":"1416220","reading":"たち"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"長い","vocabId":"1429750","reading":"ながい"},{"surface":"議論","vocabId":"1226160","reading":"ぎろん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"経","vocabId":"1956170","reading":"きょう","baseForm":"経る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"決定","vocabId":"1254380","reading":"けってい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"下し","vocabId":"1184290","reading":"くだし","baseForm":"下す"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"多くの修練を経て、彼は達人のレベルになった。","romaji":"Ōku no shuren o hete, kare wa tatsujin no reberu ni natta.","en":"Through a lot of training, he reached a master's level.","words":[{"surface":"多く","vocabId":"1861770","reading":"おおく"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"修練","vocabId":"1594800","reading":"しゅうれん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"経","vocabId":"1956170","reading":"きょう","baseForm":"経る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"達人","vocabId":"1416250","reading":"たつじん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"レベル","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"なる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]}],"formalityLevel":"very-formal-literary","usageNote":"Formal, literary \"via/through (a process or stage)\" - describes a path or progression.","family":{"id":"through","name":"Through (Via / Over A Range)","relatedPoints":["n2-171","n2-119","n2-118"]}}